{"page":117,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:51","surah":5,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَتَّخِذُوا۟ ٱلْيَهُودَ وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰٓ أَوْلِيَآءَ ۘ بَعْضُهُمْ أَوْلِيَآءُ بَعْضٍ ۚ وَمَن يَتَوَلَّهُم مِّنكُمْ فَإِنَّهُۥ مِنْهُمْ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, do not take the Jews and Christians as allies:they are allies only to each other. Anyone who takes them as an ally becomes one of them- God does not guide such wrongdoers-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَتَّخِذُوا۟","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْيَهُودَ","en_gloss":"the Jews","transliteration":"l-yahūda","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"and the Christians","transliteration":"wal-naṣārā","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ ۘ","en_gloss":"(as) allies","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعْضُهُمْ","en_gloss":"Some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءُ","en_gloss":"(are) allies","transliteration":"awliyāu","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(to) others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَتَوَلَّهُم","en_gloss":"takes them as allies","transliteration":"yatawallahum","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"5:51"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"then indeed, he","trans